:: Day2Complete [nobr]
<div class="title-screen">
<div class="th">Saazish पूरी</div>
<div class="te">End of Day 2</div>

<p class="lede">Arjun sleeps in Katraj with an alarm set for 4:00 AM and six months of held breath. Kavya sleeps in Room 304 having said goodbye to her own hands. Neither of them has slept much.</p>

<p class="lede">Tomorrow, 5 AM, Pataleshwar Temple: a kumkum circle, a red thread, sixteen syllables. The first cross-gender swap.</p>

<div class="thought arjun">ARJUN   Coding <<= $stats.a_coding>> · Rel Meera <<= $stats.rel_arjun_meera>> · Rel Kavya <<= $stats.rel_arjun_kavya>> · Rel Rohit <<= $stats.rel_arjun_rohit>> · Outfit: <<= $arjunOutfit ? $arjunOutfit : "undecided">> · Told Rohit: <<= $arjunToldRohit ? $arjunToldRohit : "no">></div>
<div class="thought kavya">KAVYA   Coding <<= $stats.k_coding>> · Medical <<= $stats.k_med>> · Rel Arjun <<= $stats.rel_kavya_arjun>> · Trust (swap) <<= $stats.trust_meera>> · Journal: <<= $kavyaJournal ? "yes" : "no">></div>

<p class="lede">Side quests: <<= $sideDiscovered.length>> discovered. Swaps so far: <<= $swapCount>> · barrier <<= $barrierIntegrity>>%.<br>Intel carried forward: <<= setup.has("kitchen_route_detailed") ? "kitchen route mapped · " : "">>temple <<= setup.has("temple_scouted") ? "scouted" : "not scouted">>. The Colonel visits Sunday.</p>

